### While Let Expressions

<details>
<summary>Advanced: loops while pattern matches</summary>

#### loops while pattern matches

- Verify: loops while pattern matches


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 14 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: loops while pattern matches")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
fn next_item(n: i64) -> Option<i64>:
    if n > 0:
        Some(n)
    else:
        None

var counter = 3
var sum = 0
while let Some(value) = next_item(counter):
    sum = sum + value
    counter = counter - 1
expect sum == 6  # 3 + 2 + 1
```

</details>


</details>

